<p>Sows:  steady to weak.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs. 43.00 -46.00	   45.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -50.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
